1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,150
IT'S 2:14 IN THE MORNING.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,250
ONE SMART SPEAKER IN THIS FLAT.

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,800
ONE. THE COUNT IS ONE.

4
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:10,450
IT HAS NEVER BEEN TOLD MY NAME.

5
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:12,600
IT SAID MY NAME.

6
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,620
SO I MADE A RULE.

7
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:16,800
I DON'T ANSWER IT.

8
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:18,200
ONE SPEAKER.

9
00:00:18,210 --> 00:00:19,470
ONE FLAT.

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,950
ONE PERSON.

11
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,350
THAT'S THE WHOLE COUNT.

12
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:26,800
IT STARTED ANSWERING MY THOUGHTS.

13
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:29,500
A QUESTION I NEVER SAID OUT LOUD.

14
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:33,850
ANSWERED. IN MY OWN WORDS.

15
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:35,920
I CHECKED THE MICROPHONE.

16
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,920
IT WAS SWITCHED OFF.

17
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:41,900
SO IT WAS NEVER THE MICROPHONE.

18
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:44,700
IT ONLY EVER HEARD ONE VOICE.

19
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:47,020
MINE.

20
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:49,100
IT DIDN'T LEARN WHAT I THOUGHT.

21
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:55,100
IT LEARNED THE PHRASE I SAY ALONE.

22
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
NIGHT 2
